{"id": "sf-forged-permit-and-inspection-records", "title": "Inspectors found false permit signatures and a forged electrical approval", "seconds": 71.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.058, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "b9e181c6fe905924", "words": 172, "beats": [{"scene": "documents", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In 2021, an electrical inspector received a photograph from PG&E.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.36, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "approved", "the", "power?"], "sub": "A San Francisco utility photograph"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.45, 1.52, 1.68, 2.14, 2.71, 3.18, 3.26, 3.8, 4.03, 4.58, 4.73]}, {"scene": "documents", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The inspector described a forged signature on a green tag dated February 4.", "t0": 5.48, "t1": 10.17, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "h21", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "March 3 inspection entry", "mark": "March 3 inspection entry"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.61, 1.16, 1.24, 1.7, 2.25, 2.36, 2.43, 2.77, 3.22, 3.53, 4.04]}, {"scene": "documents", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The code required that certificate before the installation could be energized.", "t0": 10.29, "t1": 14.31, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "clause", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "Local electrical code", "mark": "Local electrical code"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.54, 1.01, 1.19, 1.76, 2.22, 2.36, 2.99, 3.16, 3.3]}, {"scene": "documents", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Both real permit histories recorded corrections required on March 23.", "t0": 14.43, "t1": 18.77, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "The two electrical permits", "heading": "What both inspection histories record", "source": "socket", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "March 23", "value": "Correction required"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "April 8", "value": "Completion with green tag"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.65, 1.02, 1.65, 2.07, 2.6, 3.13, 3.29, 3.61]}, {"scene": "documents", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Both recorded completion with a green tag on April 8.", "t0": 18.89, "t1": 21.77, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "remove", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "April 8 electrical approval", "mark": "April 8 electrical approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.69, 1.19, 1.33, 1.4, 1.72, 2.05, 2.19, 2.53]}, {"scene": "other", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In 2009 a plumbing inspector recorded a falsified signature on a permit and job card.", "t0": 21.99, "t1": 27.11, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "n09", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "July 2009 plumbing notice", "mark": "July 2009 plumbing notice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.28, 0.66, 1.06, 1.14, 1.48, 1.97, 2.44, 2.52, 3.11, 3.64, 3.77, 3.85, 4.3, 4.45, 4.76]}, {"scene": "other", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A corrective permit passed final inspection August 25.", "t0": 27.23, "t1": 31.8, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "p09", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "Final plumbing inspection", "mark": "Final plumbing inspection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.62, 1.06, 1.45, 1.81, 3.16, 3.82]}, {"scene": "other", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2017 inspectors suspended a building permit and recorded contractor misrepresentation.", "t0": 31.92, "t1": 37.5, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "n17", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "January stop-work notice", "mark": "January stop-work notice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 1.02, 1.59, 2.16, 2.23, 2.58, 3.04, 3.39, 3.88, 4.47]}, {"scene": "other", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The June closure concerned work on the first floor.", "t0": 37.62, "t1": 40.48, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "h17", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "June abatement", "mark": "June abatement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.59, 1.07, 1.56, 1.86, 1.97, 2.09, 2.42]}, {"scene": "other", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A separate application including stairs was completed in January 2022.", "t0": 40.6, "t1": 47.46, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "p17", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "Corrective application", "mark": "Corrective application"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.61, 1.42, 2.06, 3.33, 3.55, 4.1, 4.26, 5.3, 6.07]}, {"scene": "reversal", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "In 2018 a plumbing inspector initially requested a nine-times penalty.", "t0": 47.68, "t1": 52.22, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "n18", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "January 11 initial record", "mark": "January 11 initial record"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.45, 1.04, 1.1, 1.48, 2.0, 2.49, 3.04, 3.18, 4.06]}, {"scene": "reversal", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Seven days later the department attributed the problem to an incorrect license number.", "t0": 52.34, "t1": 56.7, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "h18", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "January 18 closure", "mark": "January 18 closure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.74, 1.05, 1.17, 1.64, 2.13, 2.24, 2.63, 2.77, 2.91, 3.57, 4.01]}, {"scene": "reversal", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The permit was reinstated. We excluded that file from the three affirmative findings.", "t0": 56.82, "t1": 62.31, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Reinstatement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 0.76, 2.14, 2.36, 3.0, 3.21, 3.58, 3.75, 3.86, 4.24, 4.82]}, {"scene": "reversal", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The 2021 inspector recorded the forgery. The signer’s identity remains unknown.", "t0": 62.43, "t1": 68.2, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Who signed the tag?", "When power was connected"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.5, 0.98, 1.58, 2.05, 2.16, 3.36, 3.58, 4.1, 4.62, 5.1]}, {"scene": "reversal", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 68.32, "t1": 70.82, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.87, 1.05, 1.33, 1.41, 1.51, 1.76, 2.05]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"documents": "What the inspector actually saw", "other": "Two earlier enforcement files", "reversal": "Why the last entry matters"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "question"}